	.global LilycoveCity_Text_TeamAquaLotGoneForGood
HE_English_414::
	.string "The signal vanished... Where is the\ndevice?$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_NotAOneToBeFound
HE_English_415::
	.string "RESEARCHER: Did you come from\nPetalburg? I need to reach Roxanne.\pI worked on Devon's sensors. I found\nsabotage orders signed by Rocket!\pThey call the plan Operation Eclipse.$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_HaveYouSeenShroomish
HE_English_416::
	.string "ROCKET: Did you think the forest would\nhide you?\pYou took documents belonging to our\noperation!$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_IWasGoingToAmbushYou
HE_English_417::
	.string "ROCKET: Will you defend this man?\pHoenn is already falling. When the\nLeague loses control, we'll take over.\pStep aside or face Rocket!$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_NoOneCrossesTeamAqua
HE_English_418::
	.string "How did a child stop me?!$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_YoureKiddingMe
HE_English_419::
	.string "ROCKET: Enjoy your victory.\pOur Rustboro transmitter has already\nreceived its orders. This forest was\ponly the test.\pHoenn's sky will go dark!$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_YouveGotSomeNerve
HE_English_420::
	.string "RESEARCHER: You saved us!\pTake this Great Ball. A new partner can\nmake all the difference.$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_ThatWasAwfullyClose
HE_English_421::
	.string "The devices force Pokémon to flee and\noverload power plants.\pRocket is causing the collapse to sell\nthe cities false protection!$"

	.global PetalburgWoods_Text_TeamAquaAfterSomethingInRustboro
