	.string "Roxanne turned the Gym into a support\nstation.\pShe uses Rock Pokémon. Water and Grass\nmoves are effective.\pPrepare your team. Training builds\nconfidence, too!$"

	.global RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice
HE_English_431::
	.string "Your victory gave the shelter hope! The\nfirst badge is yours.$"

	.global RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory
