	.global DewfordTown_Text_FishingAdvice
HE_English_483::
	.string "RESIDENT: The lights went out and the\nboats lost their way!\pBrawly is protecting the shelter. A\nbuzzing comes from Granite Cave, to the\pnorth.\pDid you bring the decoder? Maybe you\ncan end our isolation.$"

	.global HE_Text_DewfordArrival
HE_English_484::
	.string "Welcome to POKéMON HOENN EXPANSION!\pI'm Professor Birch. My research\nchanged when the signals began to fail.$"

	.global gText_Birch_Welcome
HE_English_485::
	.string "This is a POKéMON.\pToday, many are fleeing their habitats.$"

	.global gText_Birch_Pokemon
HE_English_486::
	.string "Hoenn welcomed species from other\nregions, from Johto to Alola.\pBut the recent migration isn't natural.\nDevon's sensors recorded pulses before\peach exodus.\pTeam Rocket seized communications and\noffers shelter in exchange for\pfamilies' Pokémon.\pThe League is responding. I need to\ndiscover how they control the network\pand gather evidence.\pYou'll meet Pokémon, Gym Leaders and\npeople trying to protect their homes.\pOne journey can bring hope back.$"

	.global gText_Birch_MainSpeech
HE_English_487::
	.string "Before we begin, who are you?$"

	.global gText_Birch_AndYouAre
HE_English_488::
	.string "Are you a boy or a girl?$"

	.global gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl
HE_English_489::
	.string "What is your name?$"

	.global gText_Birch_WhatsYourName
HE_English_490::
	.string "So your name is {PLAYER}?$"

	.global gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer
HE_English_491::
	.string "{PLAYER}, you're arriving in\nLittleroot.\pI brought three partners: Rowlet,\nCyndaquil and Oshawott.\pOne of them can begin this journey with\nyou.$"

	.global gText_Birch_YourePlayer
HE_English_492::
	.string "You don't have to solve everything\nalone.\pTrust your Pokémon and the allies you\nmeet.\pYour diary will record your next mission.\pCome to my laboratory. Let's turn what\nwe've seen into evidence and protect\pHoenn.$"

	.global gText_Birch_AreYouReady
HE_English_493::
	.string "BRINEY: Where shall we go?$"

	.global DewfordTown_Text_WhereAreWeBound
HE_English_494::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX!$"

	.global LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedPokedex
